    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22">

                <pb facs="0041" n="34" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg34"/>

                <head>No. 22.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Braida.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-28"><hi rendition="#italic">March 28,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You are not authorized to perform diplomatic functions, and will not meddle in
                    political affairs in Mosquito. Naval vessel will soon reach Bluefields.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
